The MIT terms above cover the CleeCode source code. Bundled third-party assets
keep their own licenses:

  assets/fonts/CleeCodeMonoNerdFont-Regular.ttf
      A Nerd Font-patched build of JetBrains Mono, distributed under the SIL Open
      Font License 1.1. The full license text ships alongside it in
      assets/fonts/OFL.txt. JetBrains Mono is released under the OFL with no
      Reserved Font Name, so redistribution and modification are permitted and
      no renaming is required; the file carries this project's name for clarity,
      while the font's own family name remains "JetBrainsMono NFM".
